[engl]
{100}{}{Overseer}
{200}{}{You see the Vault 13 Overseer.}

{1000}{}{Initial check}
{1010}{}{Dumb character}
{1020}{}{Normal - Quest not started}
{1030}{}{Normal - Quest in progress}
{1040}{}{Normal - Quest finished}

{2000}{}{Ahh, you're here. Good. Well, only good that you're here. We've got a problem. A big one.}
{2010}{}{Unh?}
{2020}{}{Nuh-uh.}

{3000}{}{Ahh, you're here. Good. Well, only good that you're here. We've got a problem. A big one. The controller chip for our water purification system has given up the ghost. We can't make another one and the process is too complicated for a work-around system. Simply put, we're running out of drinking water. No water, no Vault.}
{3010}{}{Sounds serious. What do you need me to do?}
{3020}{}{Not now, I'm busy.}

{4000}{}{Now we both know we've had our differences as you've grown up. You've got the wanderlust in you. Seriously, this is crucial to our survival. And frankly, I think you're the only hope we have. You need to go find us another controller chip.}
{4010}{}{Where should I start looking?}

{5000}{}{We estimate we have four to five months before the vault runs out of water. We need that chip!}
{5010}{}{I'll do it.}
{5020}{}{Yeah, well I guess you'll have to find someone else to do your dirty work.}

{6000}{}{One month . . . two . . . four . . . five . . . six . . . You have four to five months before we run out of water. We need that chip!}
{6010}{}{Ok.}
{6020}{}{Nuh-uh.}

{7000}{}{We marked your map with the location of another Vault. Not a bad place to start, I think. Here's some equipment you'll probably need. Be safe, find that chip, and get back here, OK?}
{7010}{}{Ok. I'll be back.}

{8000}{}{We marked your map with the location of another Vault. Go find that chip! Here's some equipment. Be safe, OK?}
{8010}{}{Ok.}

{9000}{}{Have you found the chip yet? We're running out of time!}
{9010}{}{Not yet. I'm still looking.}

{9100}{}{The water supply has stabilized thanks to you!}
{9110}{}{Glad I could help.}